Lightweight homes, warps, TPA, back, RTP, timber, player inventories, and player toggles for [B]Spigot[/B].

Players get a shared teleport countdown, a simple GUI, and translatable messages. Operators get warps, home limits, reload, and an optional GitHub update notice.

AuraUtils does [B]not[/B] include an economy. Pair it with [URL='https://github.com/TamaWish/PureEconomy']PureEconomy[/URL] for a lightweight utilities + economy stack. They talk through [URL='https://www.spigotmc.org/resources/vault.4536/']Vault[/URL]; AuraUtils charges PureEconomy's default currency. Neither plugin requires the other.

[IMG]https://files.catbox.moe/foxbd8.png[/IMG]

Install [B]AuraUtils-<version>-spigot.jar[/B] in [ICODE]plugins/[/ICODE]. The spigot and paper-folia filenames are copies of the same shaded bytecode; Spigot behavior is detected at runtime.

[TABLE]
[TR][TH]Server[/TH][TH]Install[/TH][/TR]
[TR][TD]Spigot[/TD][TD][ICODE]AuraUtils-<version>-spigot.jar[/ICODE][/TD][/TR]
[/TABLE]

[LIST]
[*]Place the matching JAR in [ICODE]plugins/[/ICODE].
[*]Restart the server.
[*]Edit [ICODE]plugins/AuraUtils/config.yml[/ICODE] if you want.
[*]On first start the plugin copies [ICODE]lang/en.yml[/ICODE]. Translate it or add another locale and set [ICODE]language:[/ICODE].
[*]Run [ICODE]/aura reload[/ICODE] ([ICODE]aura.admin[/ICODE]) after config or language edits.
[/LIST]

[IMG]https://files.catbox.moe/p0ee9p.png[/IMG]
[LIST]
[*]Homes with optional GUI, name rules, overwrite confirm, and optional limits
[*]Server warps with optional GUI and overwrite confirm
[*]Timed TPA plus a trusted list that auto-accepts requests
[*][ICODE]/back[/ICODE], safe [ICODE]/rtp[/ICODE], god, fly, nofall, nohunger, timber
[*]Extra player inventories ([ICODE]/inv 1[/ICODE], [ICODE]/inv 2[/ICODE], …) with rank limits
[*][ICODE]/menu[/ICODE] utility GUI
[*]Shared countdown: chat, action bar, title, cancel on move/damage, rising-pitch sounds
[*][ICODE]aura.teleport.bypass[/ICODE] for instant teleports
[*]Optional Vault economy costs for home, warp, TPA, RTP, and back
[*]All player-facing text in [ICODE]lang/en.yml[/ICODE]
[/LIST]

Trusted TPA: [ICODE]/tpatrust <player>[/ICODE] adds them to your list. They can [ICODE]/tpa[/ICODE] you without [ICODE]/tpaccept[/ICODE]. Manage with [ICODE]/tpatrust list[/ICODE] and [ICODE]/tpauntrust <player>[/ICODE]. Cancel a countdown or an outgoing TPA with [ICODE]/tpacancel[/ICODE] ([ICODE]/tpcancel[/ICODE], [ICODE]/auracancel[/ICODE]).

Timber: with [ICODE]timber.enabled: true[/ICODE] (default), chopping a log with an axe fells the connected tree. [ICODE]/timber[/ICODE] turns it off for you. Sneak to chop a single log.

Player inventories: [ICODE]/inv 1[/ICODE] is a personal double chest. Normal ranks get that one inventory. Give a rank more with a single node — [ICODE]aura.inv.3[/ICODE] allows [ICODE]/inv 1[/ICODE]–[ICODE]3[/ICODE]. Works with LuckPerms or any other permission plugin.

[IMG]https://files.catbox.moe/pwsw8n.png[/IMG]
