[B][SIZE=5]Changelog[/SIZE][/B]

[B]1.4.0[/B]
[B]Added[/B]
[LIST]
[*][B]Player inventories[/B] — [ICODE]/inv 1[/ICODE], [ICODE]/inv 2[/ICODE], … extra double-chest storage. Default players get inventory 1. Grant [ICODE]aura.inv.<n>[/ICODE] with any permission plugin ([ICODE]aura.inv.3[/ICODE] = inventories 1–3).
[*][B]Timber[/B] — chop one log with an axe to fell the connected tree ([ICODE]timber.enabled[/ICODE] true/false). [ICODE]/timber[/ICODE] to opt out. Sneak chops a single log.
[*][B]permissions.yml[/B] — set each node's default to [ICODE]true[/ICODE], [ICODE]false[/ICODE], or [ICODE]op[/ICODE]. [ICODE]/aura reload[/ICODE] applies it. LuckPerms still overrides per player.
[*]Optional Vault economy costs ([ICODE]economy.costs[/ICODE] for home, sethome, warp, setwarp, tpa, rtp, back). Defaults are free. Missing Vault keeps every action free.
[*]Charge on success; cancelled countdown is not charged; failed teleport is refunded
[*][ICODE]aura.economy.bypass[/ICODE] skips costs; GUI lore shows the price when you would be charged
[/LIST]
[B]Fixed[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Paper shutdown no longer throws [ICODE]World unloaded[/ICODE] while saving homes and warps. Destinations store world name + coordinates instead of calling [ICODE]Location.getWorld()[/ICODE] after worlds are gone.
[/LIST]

[B]1.3.0[/B]
[B]Added[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Translatable messages in [ICODE]lang/en.yml[/ICODE]; set [ICODE]language:[/ICODE] and add [ICODE]lang/<code>.yml[/ICODE] for extra locales
[*][ICODE]/aura reload[/ICODE] reloads config and language ([ICODE]aura.admin[/ICODE])
[*]Home limits: [ICODE]homes.default-limit[/ICODE] and permission-based [ICODE]homes.limits[/ICODE] (set a positive default before VIP caps)
[*]Safer [ICODE]/sethome[/ICODE] / [ICODE]/setwarp[/ICODE]: 1–32 letter/number/[ICODE]_[/ICODE]/[ICODE]-[/ICODE] names and clickable overwrite confirm
[*]Optional GitHub update checker ([ICODE]update-checker.enabled[/ICODE]); [ICODE]aura.admin[/ICODE] gets a clickable releases link
[/LIST]
[B]Fixed[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Concurrent TPA request lifecycle (cancel / player quit)
[*]Folia-safe pending teleport and [ICODE]/back[/ICODE] state
[*]Paper async RTP chunk-load detection
[*]Teleport success waits for the async result (trusted instant TPA and countdown-0 home/warp/back included)
[*][ICODE]/aura[/ICODE] status shows ON/OFF instead of raw keys, and color no longer leaks onto Fly / NoHunger labels
[/LIST]
[B]Changed[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Package [ICODE]com.lozaine.aurautils[/ICODE] (main class [ICODE]com.lozaine.aurautils.AuraUtils[/ICODE])
[*]Marketplace filename: [ICODE]AuraUtils-<version>-spigot.jar[/ICODE] (same bytecode as [ICODE]AuraUtils-<version>-paper-folia.jar[/ICODE])
[/LIST]

[B]1.2.2 — RTP watchdog / Folia TPA[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Spigot [ICODE]/rtp[/ICODE] no longer generates unloaded chunks on the tick thread
[*]Folia [ICODE]/tpaccept[/ICODE] hops to the requester’s entity thread
[*]Teleport success only after the teleport future completes
[/LIST]

[B]1.2.0 — Trusted / instant TPA[/B]
[LIST]
[*][ICODE]/tpatrust[/ICODE], [ICODE]/tpauntrust[/ICODE] — personal trusted list; trusted players auto-accept TPA
[*]Config: [ICODE]tpa.trusted-max[/ICODE], [ICODE]tpa.trusted-instant[/ICODE]
[*]Permission [ICODE]aura.tpa.trust[/ICODE] (default: true)
[/LIST]

[B]1.1.1 — Folia fixes[/B]
[LIST]
[*]RTP height/surface checks on the target location’s region
[*][ICODE]/back[/ICODE] records location before teleport (Folia often skips PlayerTeleportEvent)
[/LIST]

[B]1.1.0 — Folia support[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Region-aware scheduling ([ICODE]folia-supported: true[/ICODE])
[*]Async teleport on Paper / Folia
[/LIST]

[B]1.0.0 — Initial release[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Homes, warps, TPA, back, RTP, god, fly, nofall, nohunger, menu, [ICODE]/aura[/ICODE]
[*]Shared teleport countdown · Minecraft 1.21.x and 26.1 / 26.2 · Java 21+
[/LIST]
